id: oozaru-monkey-mayhem
name: Monkey Mayhem
order: 3
slot: mastery
mastery: 1
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
# (1) M levels of Rampaging lost.
aspects: -Rampaging (LV M)
description: >
  Your conscious mind melds with that of the beast within, giving you some measure of control over your actions.
text: >
  Monkey Mayhem (1): Your conscious mind melds with that of the beast within, giving you some measure of control over your actions.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Oozaru loses M levels of the Rampaging Aspect and gains an Attribute Modifier Bonus (IN) of +1(T).
  (2)-[Passive]: Ignore the 4th effect of Furious Beast and the 1st and 2nd effects of Rampaging Assault.

---

# (1) Insight Attribute Modifier Bonus 1(T).
[passive, effect 1]
insight.mod += 1(T);

